      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Embedding Task**\n\nI'm focusing on creating the `embed_text.py` file, aiming to generate an embedding vector for a text string. The key decision is the embedding provider, and I've settled on Google Cloud Vertex AI due to its widespread use and familiarity. Next, I'll start coding the file using the chosen provider.\n\n\n**Implementing the Core Logic**\n\nI've initiated the `embed_text.py` file and am now writing code for it. I'm leveraging the Google Cloud Vertex AI client library. This involves initializing Vertex AI and specifying the text embedding model, likely `text-embedding-004`. The objective is to ensure the code can accept a text input and return its corresponding embedding vector.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865475271,
          "start": 1789865474122
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4bb84a001kiDa1aC01CmNgu",
